      "note": "The upstream archive identifies Topaz_a1200_v1.0 as the faithful original Kickstart 2.x face used through Workbench 3.1 and releases its font conversions under GPL-FE. Production bundles the pinned TTF as a separate resource with the upstream README, GPL v2 text, font-exception notice, checksums, and source URL. CoreText reports the family as `Topaz a600a1200a400`; that exact embedded name is load-bearing because the human-readable upstream description spells the final model A4000.",
